## Required Manual Steps

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **3 manual steps are needed before testing:**

1. **Run SQL migration** against your PostgreSQL:
   ```sql
   -- Execute: backend/src/db/migrations/create_gifts_table.sql
   ```

2. **Download .glb 3D models** — 10 files needed in `assets/models/`:
   - `tet/`: `lixi_red.glb`, `lixi_gold.glb`, `lixi_hoamai.glb`, `lixi_dragon.glb`, `lixi_phucloc.glb`
   - `valentine/`: `heart_box.glb`, `ribbon_box.glb`, `teddy.glb`, `bouquet.glb`, `chocolate.glb`

3. **Run `flutter pub get`** to install `ar_flutter_plugin`
